Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 12:59:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 27/50] fix: derive EnGenius Wi-Fi MACs from LAN MAC;
 EWS377-FIT hardware-validated

ART on the EWS377-FIT holds placeholder Wi-Fi MACs, so both radios got a
random MAC on every boot. 11_fix_wifi_mac now derives them from the
unit's real MAC (u-boot env ethaddr, exposed on the lan port via nvmem).

- add ews377ap-v3-port/build-skus.sh: build each SKU as its own profile;
  a multi-profile build shared one rootfs and shipped the EWS377AP v3
  board-2.bin on every SKU, so the FIT radios never started
- add the EWS377-FIT hardware validation report and port status update
- refresh the FIT DTS header now that a real unit has been tested
